      "text": "READ: La Salle Green Hills (LSGH) released a statement after the Metro Manila Development Authority (MMDA) raised concerns regarding the traffic congestion along the school's portion of Ortigas Avenue.\n\n\"We wish to assure our community and the public that the school is actively collaborating with the MMDA to address concerns regarding public safety and the orderly flow of traffic,\" LSGH said in its statement. \n\nCourtesy: La Salle Green Hills/Facebook",
